Below are three popular, production‑grade options (choose whichever matches your cloud provider or on‑prem stack). All of them **avoid storing secrets in source control** and provide **automatic rotation, audit logs, and encryption at rest**.

| Platform | Typical Integration (Node) | Pros | Cons |
|----------|----------------------------|------|------|
| **AWS Secrets Manager** | `const { SecretsManagerClient, GetSecretValueCommand } = require("@aws-sdk/client-secrets-manager");` | Integrated IAM, automatic rotation, fine‑grained policies. | Cost (~$0.40/secret/month) |
