### Why This Is Better

| Security Gain | Description |
|---------------|-------------|
| **Encryption at rest** | AWS stores the secret encrypted with a KMS‑managed key. |
| **IAM‑based access control** | Only the instance role (or a specific IAM user) can read the secret. |
| **Auditable access** | Every `GetSecretValue` call is logged in CloudTrail. |
| **Automatic rotation** | You can enable rotation (e.g., every 30 days) without code changes. |
| **No secrets on disk** | The secret lives only in memory for the lifetime of the process. |

